    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: You probably noticed that your <b>Hierarchy</b> window is now more cluttered than ever, since it has pushable furniture, decorative rugs, and a whole bunch of new collectibles. Take a moment to clean up and organize your <b>Hierarchy</b> window.
